<p class="[display:var(--p-inside-li-display,block)] [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Standalone element <code class="text-base [word-break:var(--inline-code-word-break,break-word)] font-medium font-mono bg-[var(--inline-code-bg,var(--bg-base-300))] rounded-md text-[var(--inline-code-text,var(--custom-color-text))] px-(--spacing-xs) py-[0.1em]">&amp;</code> is inserted before the last element. All of this is done to improve readability and user experience.</p>
